ICCV-2023-P0051,ICCV-2023-A000258,Etai Sella,shared,3,4,4,"Google Research “A yarn doll of a ⟨object⟩” Figure . Given multiview images of an object (left), our technique generates volumetric edits from target text prompts, allowing for significant geometric and appearance changes, while faithfully preserving the input object. The objects can be edited either locally (center) or globally (right), depending on the nature of the user-provided text prompt.",0,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P0051.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Sella_Vox-E_Text-Guided_Voxel_Editing_of_3D_Objects_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
