ICCV-2023-P0363,ICCV-2023-A001955,Wenjia Wang,shared,3,9,9,"The University of Hong Kong The University of Adelaide SenseTime Research Shanghai AI Laboratory Zhejiang University FoV = ° z = .94m (b) SPEC (a) Input image FoV = ° z = .28m (c) Our results (d) Input image (e) SPEC (f) Our results Figure : Close-up photography can make it difficult to discern 3D human pose in perspective-distorted images, while stateof-the-art methods often struggle with weak-perspective camera models or inaccurate focal length estimates. Our method overcomes these challenges, accurately recovering 3D human mesh from an approximate distance for fine-grained reconstruction. We could thus get focal length by our proposed approach.",-1,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P0363.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Wang_Zolly_Zoom_Focal_Length_Correctly_for_Perspective-Distorted_Human_Mesh_Reconstruction_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
