ICCV-2023-P0411,ICCV-2023-A002209,Songwei Ge,shared,3,4,4,"University of Maryland, College Park Adobe Research Carnegie Mellon University A pizza with pineapples, pepperonis, and mushrooms on the top, 4k, photorealism. A night sky filled with stars above a turbulent sea with giant waves. A close-up of a cat1 riding a scooter. Tropical trees in the background. A young woman1 sits at a table in a beautiful, lush A nightstand1 next to a bed with pillows on it. Gray garden, reading a book on the table. wall2 bedroom. 1A cat wearing sunglasses and has a bandana around its neck. A marble statue of a wolf's head and shoulder, surrounded by colorful flowers Styles: Van Gogh, Hokusai. Style: Claude Monet 1Girl with a pearl earring by Johannes Vermeer. 1A nightstand with some books. 2Accent shelf with plants on the gray wall. Figure . Plain text (left image) vs. Rich text (right image). Our method allows a user to describe an image using a rich text editor that supports various text attributes such as font family, size, color, and footnote. Given these text attributes extracted from rich text prompts, our method enables precise control of text-to-image synthesis regarding colors, styles, and object details compared to plain text.",-7,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P0411.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Ge_Expressive_Text-to-Image_Generation_with_Rich_Text_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
