ICCV-2023-P0812,ICCV-2023-A004298,Omer Gralnik,shared,3,3,3,"Reichman University Technical University of Munich Reichman University Figure : Semantify offers a method to create and edit a 3D parametric model using semantically meaningful descriptors. Semantify is based on a self-supervised method that utilizes the semantic power of CLIP language-vision model to build a mapping between semantic descriptors to 3DMM model coefficients. This can be used in an interactive application defining a slider for each descriptor (a), or to fit a model to an image in a zero shot manner by feeding the image into CLIP and obtaining a vector of semantic scores that can be mapped to shape parameters (b).",-9,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P0812.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Gralnik_Semantify_Simplifying_the_Control_of_3D_Morphable_Models_Using_CLIP_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
