ICCV-2023-P1601,ICCV-2023-A008481,Jonathan Lorraine,shared,3,10,10,"...etc... NeRF text NeRF mapping network trained offline ... Requires hour Requires 1sec < per1 sec prompt 1hr per prompt Figure : Our method initially trains one network to output 3D objects consistent with various text prompts. After, when we receive an unseen prompt, we produce an accurate object in < second, with GPU. Existing methods re-train the entire network for every prompt, requiring a long delay for the optimization to complete. Further, we can interpolate between prompts for user-guided asset generation (Fig. ). We include a project webpage with an overview and videos.",-4,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P1601.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Lorraine_ATT3D_Amortized_Text-to-3D_Object_Synthesis_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
