ICCV-2023-P1635,ICCV-2023-A008688,Yihao Zhi,shared,3,7,7,"ShanghaiTech University Tencent AI Lab Intellindust INRIA Shanghai Engineering Research Center of Intelligent Vision and Imaging Shanghai Engineering Research Center of Energy Efficient and Custom AI IC from left to right SAG text script from left to right with high both hands SAG text script + prompt SAG speech audio RAG RAG Figure . We propose LivelySpeaker, a novel system that decouples the co-speech gesture generation into two stages, namely semantic-aware generator (SAG) and rhythm-aware generator (RAG), respectively. Powered by the proposed two-stage framework, our method can generate semantic-aware gestures (top three rows) other than purely audio-driven results (bottom row). We can also add additional prompts to the text script to specify the gestures (second line). Last, when we integrate the proposed components altogether, our method can still retain the semantic gestures and also appropriate rhythm for a lively speaker (third row).",-3,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P1635.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Zhi_LivelySpeaker_Towards_Semantic-Aware_Co-Speech_Gesture_Generation_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
