ICCV-2023-P1750,ICCV-2023-A009307,Baao Xie,shared,3,7,7,"Tianjin University Eastern Institute of Technology, Ningbo Ningbo Institute of Digital Twin Shanghai Jiao Tong University Northwest Normal University Zhejiang University Latent Semantic Navigation - Smile + NaviNeRF 3D Reconstruction - 3D Views + ... Figure . Generated 3D objects by NaviNeRF – a model aims to achieve fine-grained 3D disentanglement by bridging 3D reconstruction and latent semantic manipulation. The top row presents the results of shifting along the learned semantic direction that represents continuous changes in a man’s mouth, visually looks like a “smile” expression. The bottom row showcases the results of multi-view generation, which demonstrates that the attribute manipulation could still remain consistent across different views.",-7,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P1750.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Xie_NaviNeRF_NeRF-based_3D_Representation_Disentanglement_by_Latent_Semantic_Navigation_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
