ICCV-2023-P1765,ICCV-2023-A009396,Nupur Kumari,shared,3,6,6,"Tsinghua University Adobe Research Remove Van Gogh Remove Monet Remove Grumpy Cat Remove R2D2 Remove Memorized Image Remove Memorized Image Figure : Our method can ablate copyrighted materials and memorized images from pretrained text-to-image diffusion models. Our method learns to change the image distribution of a target concept to match an anchor concept, e.g., Van Gogh painting → paintings (first row), or Grumpy cat → Cat (second row). Furthermore, we extend our method to prevent the generation of memorized images (third row).",-2,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P1765.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Kumari_Ablating_Concepts_in_Text-to-Image_Diffusion_Models_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
