ICCV-2023-P1951,ICCV-2023-A010387,Junting Dong,shared,3,6,6,"NetEase Games AI Lab Input Novel view synthesis Input Novel view synthesis Figure : Given a single image of a person as input, our method can generate realistic novel view rendering. For invisible regions such as the back of the subject, we can also obtain plausible results. Instead of limited 3D scans or multi-view images, we only need monocular Internet videos for supervision, which enables it generalizable to in-the-wild images. The code and dataset are available at . Introduction",-4,data/raw/iccv/2023/first_pages/ICCV-2023-P1951.txt,https://openaccess.thecvf.com/content/ICCV2023/papers/Dong_iVS-Net_Learning_Human_View_Synthesis_from_Internet_Videos_ICCV_2023_paper.pdf
